{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4EZzbPvh4gk1Aod9uB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A deep resonance vibrates through the frame*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                ◉                 ║\n║               ╱│╲                ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\nThe bolt slides home. Tumblers fall into place — one, two, three, four — each a small iron heartbeat settling into stillness.\n\nI am shut. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe — and you will have to decide which side is which.\n\nThe wood grain tightens. The hinges hold their breath.\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":254,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}